{"id":872,"date":"2020-07-21T17:16:46","date_gmt":"2020-07-21T17:16:46","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/?post_type=rdrcnews&#038;p=872"},"modified":"2020-07-23T15:56:46","modified_gmt":"2020-07-23T15:56:46","slug":"rdrc-syep-summer-bridge-2020-employment-opportunity","status":"publish","type":"rdrcnews","link":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/rdrcnews\/rdrc-syep-summer-bridge-2020-employment-opportunity\/","title":{"rendered":"RDRC SYEP Summer Bridge 2020 Employment Opportunity"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">SYEP Summer Bridge 2020 Program Facilitator Position<\/span><!--more--><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Organization Overview<\/span>: RDRC has administered Youth Development services including the Summer Youth <\/span><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Employment Program (SYEP) for over 20+ years, servicing over 1500 youth and families<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">annually through the generous support of the <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: #b87614; text-decoration: underline;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https:\/\/www1.nyc.gov\/site\/dycd\/services\/jobs-internships\/summer-youth-employment-program-syep.page\">NYC Department of Youth and Community\u00a0<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: #b87614; text-decoration: underline;\">Development<\/span><\/span>. RDRC has provided and continues to provide employment training, and<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">opportunities to community residents. In response to the COVID-19, Social Distancing<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">guidelines, RDRC in conjunction with DYCD will administer the 2020 SYEP Summer Bridge<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">Program. This is a 100% virtual program affording participants to learn new skills and gain<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">money.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Position Overview:\u00a0Under the supervision of the Director, EECDS, and Program Coordinators, RDRC seeks to provide program participants with 60 hours of digital instruction to youth 14-15-year-old and<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">90 hours of virtual instruction to youth 16-21 in the summer months of July and August. The workshop Facilitators will be able to:<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u2022 <span style=\"color: #000080;\">Engage youth in self- guided and facilitated sessions via curriculum provided by Hats &amp;<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u00a0 \u00a0Ladders, Youth Development Institute and dbGrant Associates in a Workplace<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u00a0 \u00a0Challenge.<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u2022 Assist in the guidance through completion of a Project Based Learning Project.<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u2022 Monitor training hours.<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u2022 Submit reports weekly.<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u2022 Process and record training hours for stipend processing.<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u2022 Establishes a culture of learning to engage students in rigorous standards-based<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u00a0 \u00a0curricula to ensure students master the state standards and are prepared to enter middle<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u00a0 \u00a0school.<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u2022 Encourage youth voice &amp; choice and networking in peer relationships.<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u2022 Creates a virtual classroom environment of respect and rapport to ensure a safe, caring,<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u00a0 \u00a0and orderly environment which nurtures the unique needs of each student.<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u2022 Participates in collaborative curriculum and professional development, professional<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u00a0 \u00a0learning communities, grade-level activities, and school wide functions.<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u2022 Seeks to actively know students\u2019 strengths and challenge areas and communicates<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u00a0 \u00a0effectively with parents.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1QVLGHm1XAH2dmVATFhUieFQH_RESi4sS\/view?usp=sharing\">Download Job Description: SYEP Summer Bridge 2020 Program Faciltator\u00a0<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">For more detailed information, how to apply, contact Renee McWilliams at <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"pmcwilliams@rdrc.org\">pmcwilliams@rdrc.org<\/a><\/span>, or call 929.354.7225 or LaVerne Jeffrey at<\/span> <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"ljeffrey@rdrc.org\">ljeffrey@rdrc.org<\/a><\/span>, <span style=\"color: #000080;\">or call RDRC office, 718.327.5300, Monday-Friday, 9am-5pm.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>SYEP Summer Bridge 2020 Program Facilitator Position<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":873,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"class_list":["post-872","rdrcnews","type-rdrcnews","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/rdrcnews\/872","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/rdrcnews"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/rdrcnews"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/873"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=872"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}